===Verb===
{{head|fr|verb form|head=[[n']][[y]] [[a]][[-t-]][[il]]}}

# {{form of|fr|negative form|y a-t-il}}; isn't there? aren't there? {{q|after a modal adverb or {{m|fr|jamais}}}} there isn't, there aren't
#: {{uxi|fr|'''N'y a-t-il''' rien à faire ?|'''Isn't there''' anything to do?}}
#: {{uxi|fr|'''N'y a-t-il''' pas de trains ?|'''Aren't there''' any trains?}}
